#!/usr/bin/env -S uv run --quiet --script
# /// script
# requires-python = ">=3.12"
# dependencies = ["numpy>=2", "pyyaml>=6"]
# ///
"""The agent's iirc. The only iirc command an agent runs; on PATH as `iirc` while the plugin is enabled.

A layer over memoryfield-tool (used as published, at the commit in
iirc.pin), which keeps reading, writing, validating, and deleting pages.
It generates the tool's per-machine config from the repository location,
guards the embedding host, embeds and searches pages itself (iirc_embed.py),
computes suspicion, and records what the suggestion hook did so it can be tuned.

Usage:
  iirc search QUERY...                      ranked pages; several terms are searched separately and merged
  iirc read-matching-pages QUERY            full text of matching pages
  iirc read PAGE...                         print pages
  iirc write PAGE [flags]                   body on stdin; see write --help; --store NAME picks the store
  iirc delete PAGE
  iirc verify PAGE                          record that the page was re-confirmed
  iirc find-suspect-pages [--all]           pages with evidence they may be wrong
  iirc approve-page-check PAGE              run a page's check once and approve it on this machine
  iirc rebuild-search-index                 rebuild the search index
  iirc audit-page-findability [PAGE]        pages search shows badly, each with its fix
  iirc show-page-topics                     every topic with its page count
  iirc estimate-context-tokens              bytes and tokens of index.md and a search
  iirc doctor [--fix|--brief]               check or install prerequisites
  iirc summarize-page-usage [--days N]      how the pages are being used
  iirc max-suggested-pages [N]              pages a suggestion line names at most; N sets it on this machine
  iirc show-suggestion-thresholds           the suggestion gate's distances
  iirc set-suggestion-threshold NAME VALUE  write one into .claude/iirc.toml
  iirc tune-suggestions STEP                gather-suggestion-data, record-relevance-judgments,
                                            evaluate-suggestion-thresholds, or mark-session-tuned
  iirc set-search-backend                   the embedding model and where it runs, or string search; once per machine
  iirc init                                 create .iirc/ and the CLAUDE.md paragraph
  iirc migrate                              move a repository and this machine from the memory plugin's layout
  iirc sync                                 commit, pull, and push every remote store
  iirc show-page-stores                     list the stores
  iirc add-remote-store NAME URL            add a remote store (ask the creator first)
"""

